{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1770","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Koxia and Sequence"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Mari has three integers $$$n$$$, $$$x$$$, and $$$y$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Call an array $$$a$$$ of $$$n$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"non-negative"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if it satisfies the following conditions:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_1+a_2+\\ldots+a_n=x$$$, and "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_1 \\, | \\, a_2 \\, | \\, \\ldots \\, | \\, a_n=y$$$, where $$$|$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#OR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise OR operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"score"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of a good array is the value of $$$a_1 \\oplus a_2 \\oplus \\ldots \\oplus a_n$$$, where $$$\\oplus$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#XOR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise XOR operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Koxia wants you to find the total bitwise XOR of the scores of all good arrays. If there are no good arrays, output $$$0$$$ instead."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains three integers $$$n$$$, $$$x$$$ and $$$y$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n \\lt 2^{40}$$$, $$$0 \\leq x \\lt 2^{60}$$$, $$$0 \\leq y \\lt 2^{20}$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single integer — the total bitwise XOR of the scores of all good arrays."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 5 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n100 0 100\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n79877974817 749875791743978 982783\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n64\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, there are $$$12$$$ good arrays totally as follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[0,2,3]$$$, $$$[0,3,2]$$$, $$$[2,0,3]$$$, $$$[2,3,0]$$$, $$$[3,0,2]$$$ and $$$[3,2,0]$$$ — the score is $$$0 \\oplus 2 \\oplus 3 = 1$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[1, 2, 2]$$$, $$$[2, 1, 2]$$$ and $$$[2, 2, 1]$$$ — the score is $$$1 \\oplus 2 \\oplus 2 = 1$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[1, 1, 3]$$$, $$$[1, 3, 1]$$$ and $$$[3, 1, 1]$$$ — the score is $$$1 \\oplus 1 \\oplus 3 = 3$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Therefore, the total bitwise xor of the scores is $$$\\underbrace{1 \\oplus \\ldots \\oplus 1}_{9\\text{ times}} \\oplus 3 \\oplus 3 \\oplus 3 = 2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, there are no good sequences. The output should be $$$0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"1770F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1770/problem/F"}